    <title>Securities and Futures Commission (SFC) | LinkedIn</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Securities and Futures Commission (SFC) | 45,761 followers on LinkedIn. The Securities and Futures Commission (SFC) regulates the securities and futures markets in Hong Kong. Its responsibilities are to ensure that the markets operate fairly and efficiently, promote orderly development of the industry while protecting the interests of investors. 

The SFC is a public body operating independent of the civil service.">

