  <div class="attributed-text-segment-list__container relative mt-1 mb-1.5 babybear:mt-0 babybear:mb-0.5">
    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">The <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fsfc&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#SFC</a> welcomes the publication of the Project Ensemble Business Use Case Report by the HKMA. The report highlights valuable insights gained from industry experimentation under the Project Ensemble Sandbox and outlines the next steps towards commercialisation. 

As a co-lead of the asset management tokenisation initiatives under Project Ensemble, the SFC has worked closely with participating financial institutions to explore innovative use cases and advance the practical application of tokenisation. 

The SFC has also contributed to the development of the Project Ensemble Taxonomy. This shared taxonomy of digital finance terms is expected to establish a common understanding of key concepts, which will enable more effective cross-sector collaboration.

The SFC will continue to push forward initiatives that support the sustainable development of Hong Kong's digital finance ecosystem.</p>
